message: "If you reuse this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "RADIHALT EMF Evidence Source Index"
type: dataset
version: "2026-09-22"
date-released: 2026-09-22
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22908519"
authors:
  - name: "RADIHALT Research"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://radihalt.com/emf-studies"
abstract: >-
  RADIHALT Research maintains this open, reviewed directory to make the
  evidence behind RADIHALT's EMF education easy to inspect, cite, and reuse.
  It spans regulators, national standards, precautionary frameworks, research
  bodies, classifications, physician guidance, and studies.
keywords:
  - EMF evidence
  - radiofrequency exposure
  - exposure standards
  - precautionary policy
  - electromagnetic shielding
